{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110401001:1":{"text":"皆さーん、どうぞ彼らに盛大な拍手を！","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，请为他们送上热烈的掌声哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E867FE7BCD7F48E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110401002:1":{"text":"あの二人、魂の試練を突破したの？","source_cn":"这两个孩子，成功通过了魂之试炼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDBB5B31A143B54F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110401003:1":{"text":"確か新しくできた氏族の代表なんだよな？ウーラ？ウーフ？","source_cn":"他们代表的新氏族叫什么来着？乌拉？乌呼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x964F3238D387746B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110401004:1":{"text":"ソーン、聞こえた？僕たちのことを話してるよ！","source_cn":"听到了吗， 索恩？有人在议论我们呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B56C2174D91BFA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110401005:1":{"text":"話題にするならせめてウール族の名前ぐらい覚えてほしいものだな。","source_cn":"议论我们之前，就不能先把乌尔氏族的名字叫对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0DCED817A5A3BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110401006:1":{"text":"焦らないの、ウール族の若き勇士さん。本物の英雄なら、名が知れ渡るのは時間の問題よ。","source_cn":"何必操之过急，乌尔氏族的年轻勇者？只要是英雄，终将名满天下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0CA79E07912496E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110401007:1":{"text":"ブルータスさんだって、戦神になる前は「ブルースト」って間違われることもあったんだから。","source_cn":"即使强如布鲁特斯，成为战神前，也曾有人把他的名字错喊成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A374F359C0B947F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110401008:1":{"text":"ふふ、過去のことはどうでもいいの！今はあなたたちが<style=\"highlight\">魂の試練</style>を突破したことの方が大事よ。本当におめでとう！","source_cn":"啊，不重要了，都是些往事！现在最重要的是，你们通过了<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC36E18018EF9620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110401009:1":{"text":"でも、勝利の余韻に浸るのはここまでよ！第三の<style=\"highlight\">知恵の試練</style>は、戦神峰の麓にある特別会場で開催されるわ！","source_cn":"不过，可别高兴太久哦！第三道试炼<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BC27923DE421807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110401010:1":{"text":"アルサ……やったな。","source_cn":"阿尔萨……太好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD336965539BB7F8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_c